  "body": "<!-- THESIS: The user-selected studies form one connected Mycelium, with learning and community equally prominent.\nOWN-WORLD: Soil brown, forest, cool sage and stone; bold Manrope; photographic layers, plant sculpture and clear library controls.\nSTORY: Discover permaculture, find a starting point, and connect with others on Common Ground.\nFIRST VIEWPORT: Farm's seedling and large headline at home; panoramic type on About; big left-aligned titles and layered media in libraries. Equal learning/community actions remain on home.\nFORM: User-selected Farm-to-Fauna composition, Interstellar About and study-derived libraries. Selection key: mycelium-selected-studies-2026-10-16.\nFINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md --><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a aria-label=\"Mycelium home\" class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Mycelium\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"88\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"230px\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/></a><button aria-controls=\"site-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"menu-button\"><span>Menu</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></header>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"site-menu\" hidden=\"\" id=\"site-menu\"><div class=\"menu-links\"><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/videos/\"><span>Videos</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/courses/\"><span>Courses</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/resources/\"><span>Resources</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/about/\"><span>My story</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/events/\"><span>Events</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/newsletter/\"><span>Newsletter</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/feedback/\"><span>Get in touch</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></nav><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"watch-intro\">\n<a class=\"watch-back\" href=\"/videos/#library\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg> All videos</a>\n<div class=\"watch-heading\"><h1>How to Make a Rainwater Harvesting System</h1><div class=\"watch-credit\"><p>With Geoff Lawton</p><div class=\"watch-tags\"><span>International</span></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#the-idea\">Take a closer look <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"watch-stage\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"watch-depth\"></div><div class=\"watch-screen\"><button aria-label=\"Play How to Make a Rainwater Harvesting System\" class=\"watch-poster\" data-watch-embed=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/B-a7YrS6E8k\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"How to Make a Rainwater Harvesting System\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 90vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d3bf25fc-How-to-Make-a-Rainwater-Harvesting-S-65ae179f2269-640.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d3bf25fc-How-to-Make-a-Rainwater-Harvesting-S-65ae179f2269-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/d3bf25fc-How-to-Make-a-Rainwater-Harvesting-S-65ae179f2269-640.webp 640w, /redesign/delivery/media/d3bf25fc-How-to-Make-a-Rainwater-Harvesting-S-65ae179f2269-960.webp 960w, /redesign/delivery/media/d3bf25fc-How-to-Make-a-Rainwater-Harvesting-S-65ae179f2269-1024.webp 1024w\" width=\"1024\"/><span class=\"watch-play\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 32 32\"><path d=\"m12 7 14 9-14 9V7Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg><span>Play film</span></span></button></div></div>\n<div class=\"watch-source-line\"><span>From the Mycelium video library</span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B-a7YrS6E8k\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Open original source <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"watch-reading\" id=\"the-idea\"><div class=\"watch-reading-heading\"><h2>The idea.<br/>In practice.</h2><nav aria-label=\"On this page\"><a href=\"#the-idea\">About the film</a><a href=\"#the-educator\">The educator</a><a href=\"#watch-next\">Keep exploring</a></nav></div><div class=\"watch-prose\"><div class=\"vd-body-text\"> <p>This video demonstrates how to create a rainwater harvesting system, from collection to storage and filtration. It details the use of various roof types, gutter systems, and a simple first flush mechanism to clean water before it enters storage tanks. The video also explores different tank sizes and their ideal uses, as well as methods for maintaining water pressure and filtering water at its point of use.</p> </div><div class=\"watch-question\"><h3>What would you try?</h3><p>Take one idea into your own space, or bring a question to the community.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Discuss it in the Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"watch-educator\" id=\"the-educator\"><div><p>Learn alongside</p><h2>Geoff Lawton</h2><span></span></div><div class=\"watch-bio\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/videos/?search=Geoff%20Lawton&amp;view=shelf#library\">More from this educator <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"watch-related\" id=\"watch-next\"><header><h2>Keep exploring.</h2><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/videos/\"><span>Back to the library</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></header><div class=\"library-grid\"><article class=\"library-card filter-item\" data-category=\"international visual-learning\" data-search=\"Exploring the Food Forests of Zaytuna Farm Geoff Lawton international visual-learning\"><a href=\"/video/exploring-the-food-forests-of-zaytuna-farm/\"><div class=\"library-cover\"><img alt=\"Exploring the Food Forests of Zaytuna Farm\" class=\"\" data-lazy-media=\"\" data-src=\"